      "created_at": "2018-10-09T06:41:04Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-10-09T06:41:04Z",
      "body": "I think it is a **big security issue** to use a host, which changes every 60 seconds its IPs in an unpredictable manner. So since reports are blocked by our firewall anyway (impossible to find a static stable IP), we are forced to disable telemetry ...  ",
