      "created_at": "2020-04-26T12:29:41Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-04-26T12:29:41Z",
      "body": "Hi, \r\nI didn't want to duplicate this issue. \r\nSo I'm going to continue on this one until advised otherwise.\r\nThe pi-hole mattermost server is configured to not have telemetry activated. Their team have shown me the screenshot of the box checked to false in the settings.\r\nStill I have plenty of api.segment.io calls on my dns filtering system which is pi-hole or latter nextdns.\r\n\r\nHere are the screenshots that  I4ve taken when I had a problem before unblocking your telemetry partners. \r\n![accept cert2020-04-26 033705](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/9523075/80307601-58222e00-87ca-11ea-8e5c-e5c9a26049d3.jpg)\r\n![apsegment_blocked_nextdns2020-04-26 033853](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/9523075/80307602-59535b00-87ca-11ea-8041-e63dae59d651.jpg)\r\n![certificate error2020-04-26 033534](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/9523075/80307603-59535b00-87ca-11ea-8d26-83e57f9269dc.jpg)\r\n![segment_being_blocked2020-04-26 035628](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/9523075/80307604-59ebf180-87ca-11ea-83f2-aada8bbd54da.jpg)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
